    "title": "Officer-involved shooting in Lakewood, Colorado police say - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Parker Gordon ,\n51 minutes ago\nLAKEWOOD, Colo. ( KDVR ) -- Police in Lakewood, Colorado, is on the scene of an officer-involved shooting on Thursday night.\nThe shooting happened near the corner of West Colfax Avenue and Wadsworth Boulevard, the Lakewood Police Department said.\nThe Regional Transportation District told Nexstar's KDVR that the incident, which involved a weapon, happened on an RTD bus.\nThis is a developing story.\nCopyright 2026 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed.\nFor the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to KCAU 9 News | Sioux City, IA | News, Weather, and Sports.\nAdd to Preferred Sources",
